  TutorialStarting:
  - 1
  TutorialTasks:
  - Step: 0
    Text: Drill (2) the vein at the arrow. One drill, one line.
    Hint: Press 2, then click a tile of the vein - a drill mines only the tile it stands on.
    Target: {x: 34, y: 6}
    Opens:
    - 0
    StartsWave: 0
  - Step: 1
    Text: Drag Belt (1) from the drill into the Core - full shapes bank coins.
    Hint: Belts are dragged, one tile each - from the drill's front tile, west into the Core.
    Target: {x: 26, y: 6}
    Opens:
    - 9
    StartsWave: 0
  - Step: 2
    Text: Turret (0) on a second line, fed - wave 1 arrives when it has a round.
    Hint: A drill has one outlet - the gun needs a second vein tile belted to it.
    Target: {x: 30, y: 7}
    Opens:
    - 2
    - 10
    StartsWave: 1
  - Step: 4
    Text: Cutter (3) is two tiles across the line. Belt the front of both tiles.
    Hint: Q/E turns the ghost - the second tile is the one beside it, across the line.
    Target: {x: 32, y: 7}
    Opens: []
    StartsWave: 0
  - Step: 3
    Text: Feed the cutter's back and it cuts. Halves are what wave 2 is weak to.
    Hint: A belt must point into the cutter's back - without an inlet it never cuts.
    Target: {x: 32, y: 7}
    Opens: []
    StartsWave: 0
  - Step: 5
    Text: Run the halves to the turret (0) - wave 2 arrives when it chambers one.
    Hint: Aim one front of the cutter into the turret - the gun eats what a belt hands it.
    Target: {x: 30, y: 7}
    Opens: []
    StartsWave: 1
